    <item>
      <title>超越Sora：FastWan如何以“稀疏蒸馏”重塑实时AI视频生成范式</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/sorafastwanai-20250807154007582-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2025 15:40:07 +0800</pubDate>
